WEBVTT

00:10:27.797 --> 00:10:31.963
where we are willing to suffer
alongside the ones we love,

00:10:31.997 --> 00:10:34.163
because we love them.

00:10:35.763 --> 00:10:40.863
And can't we become
a community that plants seeds?

00:10:40.863 --> 00:10:45.197
After all, if we don't, who will?

00:10:47.563 --> 00:10:48.830
Thank you.